# Firebase
# google-services.json contains project identifiers and API keys for the
# Firebase project. It is supplied per-developer/CI machine and must never be
# committed. The app fails closed (release) when it is absent, which is the
# intended behaviour for a repository that builds without Firebase secrets.
app/google-services.json
google-services.json
